  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lao PDR: Nature Based Solutions for Urban Adaptation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Activity aims to demonstrate that community-level planning and ecosystem restoration can manage the risk of flooding and enhance community resilience; raise awareness and build capacity amongst government officials and community leaders and members; and develop a research and evidence base for further NBS and climate resilience investment.</narrative>
  </description>
